cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this resource, cite this archived release (version DOI) or the Data Descriptor; the concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.24083603 identifies the resource across versions."
title: "Cross-disease case-control transcriptome resource: analysis code and data deposit (release v1.1)"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and the eleven-folder data deposit of a cross-disease case-control
  transcriptome resource: 26 public case-control accessions across 10 disease contexts
  (25 of them in the estimates layer after patient-level de-duplication of one pancreatic
  accession), 17 frozen signalling modules (99 genes) and 425 cohort-module pairs, scored in three
  separate layers (bulk GSVA z-scores, TCGA member-mean z-scores, single-cell member
  means) with coverage-aware standardised effect sizes (SMDH, SMCRPH), REML pooling
  with Hartung-Knapp inference, and a validation ledger that separates PASS, FAIL,
  PARTIAL and NOT TESTED.
type: dataset
